                        "sense_id": "e8b62b27-2af8-3f30-a22d-d5d43f02a4ce",
                        "entry_id": "f0720097-9308-3e46-a6bd-ff1f3920f300",
                        "glosses": [
                            "секулярное движение, направленное против возможности участия и влияния религиозных организаций и духовенства в политической, экономической и культурной областях"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3e473153-ad83-4795-b89b-66ed9dba240f",
                                "sense_id": "e8b62b27-2af8-3f30-a22d-d5d43f02a4ce",
                                "text": "В идеологии буржуазных революций антиклерикализм выступал в качестве обязательного элемента."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "74eb6fe9-a0e0-47d4-ade1-5d46ef6eb91c",
                        "source_entry_id": "f0720097-9308-3e46-a6bd-ff1f3920f300",
                        "source_sense_id": "e8b62b27-2af8-3f30-a22d-d5d43f02a4ce",
                        "target_lang_word": "anticlericalism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anticlericalism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5e0d0842-83dd-311a-b61f-6ce587457831",
                                        "entry_id": "256c0dea-3373-3d29-9dd6-755051526302",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The opposition to political influence of clerics."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7210ed2-4f0d-447b-959a-1c73ec6aade0",
                                                "sense_id": "5e0d0842-83dd-311a-b61f-6ce587457831",
                                                "text": "But contacts of this kind between a senior politician of the Republic and the Catholic Church were matters of the greatest delicacy in pre-1914 France, where anticlericalism was the default setting of the political culture."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
